Artificial ORCA-4.2.1-style output for absspectra examples.

Not a real calculation. Three transitions placed at round wavenumbers with
equal oscillator strength, so a broadened spectrum must show three bands at
20000 / 25000 / 30000 cm-1 (500.0 / 400.0 / 333.3 nm) of equal peak height.

                * O   R   C   A *

-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
         ABSORPTION SPECTRUM VIA TRANSITION ELECTRIC DIPOLE MOMENTS
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
State   Energy    Wavelength  fosc         T2        TX        TY        TZ
        (cm-1)      (nm)                 (au**2)    (au)      (au)      (au)
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   1   20000.0    500.0   0.200000000   1.00000   1.00000   0.00000   0.00000
   2   25000.0    400.0   0.200000000   1.00000   1.00000   0.00000   0.00000
   3   30000.0    333.3   0.200000000   1.00000   1.00000   0.00000   0.00000

-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
